# Code owners for theapotheosisgroup/tag-skills.
#
# CODEOWNERS is not inherited from theapotheosisgroup/.github; each repository keeps its own.
# Owners are individual accounts until the organization creates teams. When it does, replace the
# entries below with a team that has write access here. A team or user without write access is
# reported as an error by GitHub, which the codeowners CI job checks.

*                     @inocult

# Published skills: anything here is installed into agent clients.
/skills/              @inocult

# CI, the validator and the pinned Skills CLI decide what counts as a valid skill.
/.github/             @inocult
/scripts/             @inocult
/package.json         @inocult
/package-lock.json    @inocult

# Security policy and ownership.
/SECURITY.md          @inocult
/CODEOWNERS           @inocult
